<title>SINGAPORE: Shell Australia to shut 10,000 t/day Geelong CDU.</title>
<headline>Shell Australia to shut 10,000 t/day Geelong CDU.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shell Company of Australia plans to shut its 10,000 tonne per day (74,000 barrels-per-day) crude distillation unit (CDU) No.4 at Geelong during the whole of May for maintenance, a company spokeswoman said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;There will be no effect or impact on supply as the refinery has two crude distillers,&quot; she said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shell has two refineries in Australia, the 115,000-bpd Geelong refinery, near Melbourne and the 80,000-bpd Clyde refinery near Sydney.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
